WEBVTT

00:11:59.436 --> 00:12:01.092
But 60 years after

00:12:01.092 --> 00:12:03.402
"The Feminine
Mystique" was published,

00:12:03.402 --> 00:12:05.703
many women actually have

00:12:05.703 --> 00:12:08.681
more choices than men do.

00:12:08.681 --> 00:12:11.409
We can decide to be a breadwinner,

00:12:11.409 --> 00:12:15.556
a caregiver, or any combination of the two.

00:12:15.556 --> 00:12:18.082
When a man, on the other hand,

00:12:18.082 --> 00:12:20.971
decides to be a caregiver,

00:12:20.971 --> 00:12:24.275
he puts his manhood on the line.

00:12:24.275 --> 00:12:27.495
His friends may praise his decision,

00:12:27.495 --> 00:12:31.367
but underneath, they're scratching their heads.